# Your Brand Looks Different Everywhere Customers Find You

Canonical source: https://webworldmaker.com/problem/inconsistent-brand-across-channels/
Scope: Machine-readable mirror of claims visible on the canonical human page.

When your business name, description, and details vary across your website, social profiles, and directory listings, it splits your entity signal for search engines and AI systems, and it looks inconsistent to a prospect doing due diligence across multiple sources.